OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FLinton Stephens with superb
OL,7,     Fperformances from the UK and
OL,8,     Fbeyond, celebrating Black British
OL,9,     Fcomposers & artists, including
OL,10,     FSamuel Coleridge-Taylor, Errollyn
OL,11,     FWallen & Segun Akinola.
OL,12,G1600 Composer of the Week: Tania Leon
OL,13,     F2/5. Kate Molleson explores the
OL,14,     Fworld of Tania Leon as the
OL,15,     Fcomposer settled in America, with
OL,16,     Fthe composer in interview.
OL,17,G1700 In Tune
OL,18,     FLive music from Chineke! Wind
OL,19,     FEnsemble. Katie in conversation
OL,20,     Fwith violinist Hyeyoon Park and
OL,21,     FToby Chadd, Artistic Director of
OL,22,     FSinfonia Smith Square.
