OL,5,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,6,     FThis week, 'Round Midnight joins
OL,7,     Fin on the BBC's The Music Is Black
OL,8,     Fseason, in collaboration with the
OL,9,     FV&A East in London.
OL,10,G0030 Through the Night
OL,11,     FOn Saint Cecilia's feast day in
OL,12,     F2024, the Danish National Vocal
OL,13,     FEnsemble and Conductor Laureate
OL,14,     FMarcus Creed marked the occasion
OL,15,     Fwith a musical celebration.
